{"publicId":"7930563b-5911-4b19-ae7c-9f9614df65b7","title":"OpenAI与四家机构签署协议，开放内部资料接受外部评估","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T10:59:54.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-17T10:59:54.000Z","digest":"OpenAI已与阿波罗研究院、METR、Transluce及Goodfire四家机构签署协议，开放部分内部资料供其评估模型与安全防护机制的风险。此举旨在应对监管压力和公众对AI安全性的担忧，四家机构将提供独立评估报告，确保透明度和安全性。根据36氪报道，这是OpenAI首次引入外部AI评估机构，评估范围涵盖模型风险、数据偏见及伦理合规性等维度。\n\n协议要求外部机构定期审查模型迭代，并公开关键评估结果。目前未披露具体评估时间表、数据范围及结果应用机制，相关细节需以官方后续披露为准。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-17T11:47:03.282Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"OpenAI签署协议引入外部AI评估机构","latestReport":{"id":"d4ljynau7u8ozp7rt6x3yfk68"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fd4wpyyPKzlA","title":"签署协议，引入外部AI评估机构","firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T10:59:54.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"d4ljynau7u8ozp7rt6x3yfk68","title":"OpenAI签署协议引入外部AI评估机构","summary":"OpenAI已与阿波罗研究院、METR、Transluce及Goodfire四家机构签署协议，开放部分内部资料，由这些机构评估其模型与安全防护机制的风险。","source":{"name":"36氪","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T10:59:54.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"d4ljynau7u8ozp7rt6x3yfk68","title":"OpenAI签署协议引入外部AI评估机构","summary":"OpenAI已与阿波罗研究院、METR、Transluce及Goodfire四家机构签署协议，开放部分内部资料，由这些机构评估其模型与安全防护机制的风险。","source":{"name":"36氪","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T10:59:54.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-17T12:00:00.000Z","heat":9.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T13:00:00.000Z","heat":9.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T14:00:00.000Z","heat":9.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T15:00:00.000Z","heat":8.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T16:00:00.000Z","heat":8.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T17:00:00.000Z","heat":8.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T18:00:00.000Z","heat":8.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T19:00:00.000Z","heat":7.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T20:00:00.000Z","heat